/span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Associated benign tumours</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Osteochondromas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Cancer-related inheritance</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Autosomal dominant</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Chromosome location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"369\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">EXT1</em> (8q24.11)</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">EXT2</em> (11p11.2)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 6; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 190.9pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong><span style=\"color: black; mso-color-alt: windowtext;\">Protein product&ndash;associated pathway</span></strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 276.4pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid w